# Phase 6 – Project Testing

## Project Name
PocketSmart AI

## Objective
The objective of testing is to verify that PocketSmart AI works correctly and that the main features produce the expected results.

## Testing Areas

1. Income Management
2. Expense Management
3. Budget Management
4. Balance Calculation
5. Transaction Tracking
6. AI Recommendation
7. Input Validation

## Test Cases

| Test ID | Feature | Test Input | Expected Result |
|---|---|---|---|
| TC01 | Add Income | ₹20,000 Salary | Income should display ₹20,000 |
| TC02 | Add Expense | ₹2,000 Food | Expense should display ₹2,000 |
| TC03 | Balance | Income ₹20,000, Expense ₹2,000 | Balance should display ₹18,000 |
| TC04 | Set Budget | ₹10,000 | Monthly budget should display ₹10,000 |
| TC05 | Add Transaction | Food ₹1,000 | Food transaction should appear |
| TC06 | Add Transaction | Shopping ₹2,000 | Shopping transaction should appear |
| TC07 | AI Recommendation | Expense below budget | Budget recommendation should appear |
| TC08 | Budget Warning | Expense above 80% | Warning recommendation should appear |
| TC09 | Invalid Income | ₹0 | Error message should appear |
| TC10 | Invalid Expense | ₹0 | Error message should appear |

## Expected Outcome

All major features should work correctly and provide the expected output.